.#-----------------------------------------------------
.input|markdown/1.2
.# Test that the macros, the HTML and the links located in wiki link labels (which were not parsed in the wiki link
.# labels written by older versions) are read as text, while the formatting and the images are kept
.#-----------------------------------------------------
[[a {{info}}x{{/info}} b|Space.Page]] [[c <b>d</b> <!-- e -->|Space.Page]] [[f <http://x.org> g@h.org|Space.Page]]
[[i [[j]] k|Space.Page]] [[**n** ![[o.png]] ![p](q.png)|Space.Page]]
.#-----------------------------------------------------
.expect|markdown/1.2
.#-----------------------------------------------------
[[a \{{info}}x\{{/info}} b|Space.Page]] [[c \<b>d\</b> \<!-- e -->|Space.Page]] [[f \<http://x.org> g@h.org|Space.Page]] [[i \[\[j\]\] k|Space.Page]] [[**n** ![[o.png&#124;o.png]] ![p](q.png)|Space.Page]]
.#-----------------------------------------------------
.expect|event/1.0
